# Cursor Cloud / Sandbox / Agent dev environment — MKM boundary (v1)

**Purpose:** Align Cursor **3.3–3.4** (Cloud Agent dev environments, multi-repo workspaces, Dockerfile IaC, PR/plan UX) with MKM **Fact-Lock**, **local/VPS 본선**, and **A/B track 격벽**. Product UI settings are configured in **Cursor Dashboard**; **operational law** for agents stays in this repo.

**SSOT pointers:** `AGENTS.md` 「Cursor · 규칙 스택」· `projects/bitcoin-trading/ops/v2/CURSOR_CHANGELOG_INTEGRATION_PLAN_2026-03-24.md` §3.3–3.4 · `docs/final/LOCAL_VS_VPS_ONE_RULE_WORKFLOW.md`.

